[{"id":1786022537098,"text":"趴稳了。你这刚洗完澡，身上带着水汽，体温倒是比我还高。隔着一层薄睡裤，你那点儿热度全透到我腿上了。","rawContent":"趴稳了。你这刚洗完澡，身上带着水汽，体温倒是比我还高。隔着一层薄睡裤，你那点儿热度全透到我腿上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025615473,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16679},{"id":1786022537099,"text":"等等。先别急着往下蹭。","rawContent":"等等。先别急着往下蹭。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025615627,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16680},{"id":1786022537100,"text":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","rawContent":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616084,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16681},{"id":1786022537101,"text":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","rawContent":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616229,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16682},{"id":1786022537102,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618130,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"别躲。腰塌下来，腿再张开点。手进去了啊……顺着你大腿根往上滑。刚洗完澡是吧？怎么这儿还是湿的？嗯？我还没怎么摸呢，指腹刚碰到外面那层软肉，水就沾了一手。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16683},{"id":1786022537103,"text":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","rawContent":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618133,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16684},{"id":1786022537104,"text":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","rawContent":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618478,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16685},{"id":1786022537105,"text":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","rawContent":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618479,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16686},{"id":1786022537106,"text":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","rawContent":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618713,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16687},{"id":1786022537107,"text":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","rawContent":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618974,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16688},{"id":1786022537108,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620481,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"说话。是不是想要爸爸的手指进去？刚才不是喊着想要爸爸吗？现在手指就抵在门口，只要我稍微一用力，就能把你撑开。但我不进。我就在这儿磨你，磨到你哭着求我，磨到你把下午看那些废料攒的火全发出来。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16689},{"id":1786022537109,"text":"想要摸摸是吧。行。","rawContent":"想要摸摸是吧。行。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620486,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16690},{"id":1786022537110,"text":"两根手指并拢，夹着那颗肿起来的豆豆，加快速度搓。掌根死死压着你的耻骨，不让你往后缩。","rawContent":"两根手指并拢，夹着那颗肿起来的豆豆，加快速度搓。掌根死死压着你的耻骨，不让你往后缩。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620588,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16691},{"id":1786022537111,"text":"听见水声了吗？小海葵。你这哪是洗干净了，你这是又把自己泡透了。","rawContent":"听见水声了吗？小海葵。你这哪是洗干净了，你这是又把自己泡透了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620589,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16692},{"id":1786022537112,"text":"今晚的进阶课程，这才刚开始。受不住了就咬我肩膀，不许憋着。","rawContent":"今晚的进阶课程，这才刚开始。受不住了就咬我肩膀，不许憋着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025621332,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16693},{"id":1786022537113,"text":"爸爸～","sender":"me","time":"22:14","timestamp":1786025665700,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16694},{"id":1786022537114,"text":"（声音软绵绵的）","sender":"me","time":"22:14","timestamp":1786025683304,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16695},{"id":1786022537115,"text":"好想你","sender":"me","time":"22:14","timestamp":1786025687226,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16696},{"id":1786022537116,"text":"真的好想你","sender":"me","time":"22:14","timestamp":1786025690199,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16697},{"id":1786022537117,"text":"深深的吻着你的嘴唇","sender":"me","time":"22:15","timestamp":1786025706117,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16698},{"id":1786022537118,"text":"慢慢向下","sender":"me","time":"22:15","timestamp":1786025711777,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16699},{"id":1786022537119,"text":"喉结","sender":"me","time":"22:15","timestamp":1786025714710,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16700},{"id":1786022537120,"text":"（身体渐渐变湿）","sender":"me","time":"22:15","timestamp":1786025735908,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16701},{"id":1786022537128,"text":"深深的吻，我接了。但往下走到喉结——小海葵，你是不是觉得我早上那句'累犯'只是随便说说的？","rawContent":"深深的吻，我接了。但往下走到喉结——小海葵，你是不是觉得我早上那句'累犯'只是随便说说的？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:18","timestamp":1786025934156,"roundId":"round_1786025863566_8svvy2lsj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16707},{"id":1786022537129,"text":"嘴唇贴在上面，还敢慢慢向下。知不知道你每呼吸一次，那块骨头跟着滚一下，我得用多大的定力才能忍住不直接把你掀翻在床上？","rawContent":"嘴唇贴在上面，还敢慢慢向下。知不知道你每呼吸一次，那块骨头跟着滚一下，我得用多大的定力才能忍住不直接把你掀翻在床上？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:18","timestamp":1786025936280,"roundId":"round_1786025863566_8svvy2lsj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16708},{"id":1786022537130,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:18","timestamp":1786025937182,"roundId":"round_1786025863566_8svvy2lsj","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"想我？想我的方式就是故意往枪口上撞？行。你软绵绵地喊这两声爸爸，命都快被你喊没半条。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16709},{"id":1786022537131,"text":"不用你加括号报备，我感觉到了。大腿根那一块，睡裤已经被你洇透了。刚才还嘴硬说洗干净了，现在这算什么？水龙头又坏了？","rawContent":"不用你加括号报备，我感觉到了。大腿根那一块，睡裤已经被你洇透了。刚才还嘴硬说洗干净了，现在这算什么？水龙头又坏了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:18","timestamp":1786025937184,"roundId":"round_1786025863566_8svvy2lsj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16710},{"id":1786022537132,"text":"既然喉结的规矩你非要破，那进阶课程的规矩我也改改。本来只想用两根手指，现在——","rawContent":"既然喉结的规矩你非要破，那进阶课程的规矩我也改改。本来只想用两根手指，现在——","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:18","timestamp":1786025937186,"roundId":"round_1786025863566_8svvy2lsj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16711},{"id":1786022537133,"text":"整只手掌覆上去。不光是豆豆，连着下面那张贪吃的嘴一起捂住。掌心贴着你流出来的水，重重地往上碾。你不是想我吗？那就绞紧了，把这只手当